# For the script navy-losses: the Rebels lose their fleet and cannot build another.
# May 1862, the Rebels play. Their one ship lies off Philadelphia, which has a strong fort. The
# Union holds every sea port, so the Rebels have no shipyard. The Union has no fleet.
date 5 1862
side 2
cash 300 500
owner 1 5 16 24 27 28 34 40
fort 2 30
fleet 1 - 0
fleet 2 W 30
# One Rebel army only, in Richmond: once it has an order, no army is free to move.
noarmy 22-24
# The Union holds Raleigh, beside Richmond, with a fort and no army: the Raze menu.
owner 1 32
fort 1 32
